ada-unlock-uefi (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the UEFI application and its locally generated NVIDIA firmware.
  * Install the application and assets into the EFI System Partition.
  * Manage the Ada Unlock UEFI boot entry and its BootOrder position.
  * Add or remove the pci=realloc GRUB command line for the 64 GiB BAR1 path.
  * Restore pre-existing files and boot entries when the package is removed.

